Package: ghindex
Type: Package
Title: Drawdown-Based Asset Risk Classification
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R: c(person("Federico P.", "Cortese", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "federico.cortese@unimi.it"),
    person("Francesco", "Bartolucci", role = "aut"),
    person("Fulvia", "Pennoni", role = "aut"))
Description: Classifies financial assets using the g- and h-index of three
    drawdown definitions. Provides cached quantmod downloads, horizon summaries,
    rolling classifications and linearized Newey-West standard errors for
    drawdown-based risk screening.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2, quantmod, xts, zoo, parallel, stats, utils
